@1 = ~We're running out of grain for our best wines. If you've any to spare, I'll pay you seventy gold coins for it. I could use fresh eggs in the kitchen, too. Meanwhile, I've got a few things ready for travellers to eat.~
@2 = ~Let me see what you have for sale.~
@3 = ~I have some grain. Will you pay 70 gold pieces?~
@4 = ~I have some eggs. Will you pay 15 gold pieces?~
@5 = ~Maybe another time.~
